---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout title="Personal Homepage" active="about">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/about.css" />
  </Fragment>

  <section id="about">
    <h2>About <span>Me</span></h2>
    <div class="img">
      <img src="/gambar/pp.jpeg" alt="Foto profil Natalio" />
      <span class="garis-lingkaran"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <h3>Data Scientist</h3>
      <p>
        <p>
  A recent Informatics Engineering graduate (S.Kom) from Sam Ratulangi University, Manado (2022–2026), graduating with a GPA of 3.89/4.00. 
  I specialize in Data Science, Machine Learning, and Data Engineering, bridging rigorous academic theory with proven industry and leadership experience. 
  My background spans working as a Data Engineer Intern at PT Telkom Akses Manado where I optimized relational databases, normalized procurement datasets, 
  and verified multi-column system data—to serving as a Google Student Ambassador leading AI adoption and technical workshops on campus. 
  As a Machine Learning graduate from Bangkit Academy (Google, GoTo, Traveloka), I built end-to-end predictive systems, fine-tuned machine learning models, 
  and collaborated on cloud deployment for healthcare solutions (FitGuard). In addition to technical certifications in Python, SQL, Power BI, and TensorFlow, 
  my foundational accuracy and adaptability are reinforced by hands-on data collection and verification roles for KPU RI, as well as a 4th-place finish in a National University Physics Olympiad. 
  I am driven to leverage end-to-end data pipelines and intelligent models to deliver scalable, real-world solutions.
</p>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
